        <mxCell id="BCUU03Ct2KNgZKFQGGL4-9" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="&lt;div&gt;1) Edge was being used before:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;a) drivers deviate to other &quot;bad&quot; routes that&amp;nbsp;could not absorb the displaced demand while maintaining similar travel costs.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;b) drivers had to continue using paths that went through the edge&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
